# Allow-list: the .vsix carries the manifest, the bundled extension and type
# libraries (dist/), the grammar, snippets, and the LUAX sources the LuaLS
# plugin loads. Everything else in luax/ (Neovim plugin, tree-sitter, CLI,
# tests) stays out.
**
!package.json
!VSCODE_README.md
!LICENSE
!language-configuration.json
!dist/**
!syntaxes/**
!snippets/**
!src/**
